---
import TransformationGallery from "./transformationGallery.astro";
---

<section
  class="page-hero principal flex flex-col sections max-w-[1150px] self-center relative items-center justify-center md:flex-row md:justify-between gap-8 z-20"
>
  <div
    class="relative flex-wrap w-full md:max-w-[350px] lg:w-[425px] lg:max-w-[425px] flex flex-col gap-8 items-center md:items-start"
  >
    <h1
      class="page-title gradient-text text-center lg:text-start"
    >
      Transforma vidas, transforma futuro
    </h1>
    <p
      class="text-center lg:text-start text-sm lg:text-base leading-6 text-white"
    >
      En Campuslands, nos dedicamos a transformar vidas a través de la educación
      tecnológica, creando un nuevo estrato social digital. Tu patrocinio educativo puede cambiar el futuro de muchos jóvenes.
    </p>
    <a
      href="https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&fs=1&to=jorge@quantic.la&su=Interés en Programa de Patrocinio - [Nombre Empresa]" 
      target="_blank" 
      rel="noopener noreferrer" 
      class="btn-primary w-full sm:max-w-[316px] h-12 lg:h-14 px-6 flex justify-center items-center gap-x-2 f-600 lg:me-auto"
    >
      Patrocina nuestros Campers
      <img
        src="/img/icons/heartdark.svg"
        alt=""
        class="hidden lg:block"
      />
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="relative flex-grow lg:flex-1 z-20 w-full max-w-[580px]">
    <TransformationGallery />
  </div>

</section>

<style scoped>
  .principal {
    background-position: 80% 0%;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    background-size: 75%;
  }
</style>
